  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in frontline offensives or major strikes prompt immediate congressional and executive-branch hearings, subpoenas and reviews of military aid, intelligence and procurement decisions, raising oversight activity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_shift</data>
</edge>
