  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Declines in critical-infrastructure resilience attributed to conflict-related attacks or failures generate contractor liability claims, regulatory enforcement actions and litigation targeting officials, increasing legal proceedings over the medium term.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_shift</data>
</edge>
