  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased investment into generative-AI and synthetic-media capabilities accelerates availability of high-quality automated content‑generation tools that Russian-aligned actors and proxies repurpose to scale deepfakes and spam narratives, raising the volume and reach of disinformation about the war.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
