  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Intensified regulatory actions against large cross-border platforms (content rules, takedown pressures) can fragment moderation practices and push users into smaller or encrypted channels with weaker moderation where Russian-origin disinformation spreads more freely, increasing prevalence in the conflict information space.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
