  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter export controls lead governments and firms to block deals, cancel joint ventures and raise compliance risk, prompting immediate reductions in inbound foreign investment and cross-border financing into affected technologies and jurisdictions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_inflation_and_rat</data>
