<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::export_controls" target="global_inflation_and_rat::portfolio_reallocation_r" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">New or tightened export restrictions force asset managers and corporate buyers to divest restricted holdings and shift weights away from targeted tech equities and regions, producing rapid portfolio reallocation across sectors and geographies.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
