  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.62</data>
  <data key="d36">Tightened export controls on advanced semiconductors and telecom components to China reduce onward shipments and stocked spare-part flows that Russia relies on for repairing battlefield-damaged power/communications infrastructure, slowing repairs and lowering resilience in the theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
