  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in proxy attacks raises geopolitical risk premiums and investor risk aversion, prompting rapid shifts of capital from equities/EM assets into safe-haven assets and cash, increasing the rate of portfolio reallocation.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
