  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in proxy attacks in the Gulf draws US/NATO naval and ISR assets and political attention away from Europe, which Russia can perceive as a window to increase strike rates and maneuvering in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
