  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in proxy attacks tied to Iran/proxies heightens US national‑security concerns and political pressure, prompting regulators (e.g., CFIUS, FCC, DOJ) to ramp up investigations, supervision, and enforcement of foreign‑linked tech firms and critical infrastructure providers.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
