  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in proxy attacks that injure personnel or assets tied to US interests triggers near-term congressional hearings, demands for briefings and formal inquiries, increasing the rate and intensity of oversight actions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
