  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Material disruptions to oil supply directly raise fuel and input costs across the economy, producing visible upward pressure on CPI components and thereby lifting market and public inflation expectations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
