  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Concrete oil supply disruptions create immediate political urgency that drives congressional hearings and bipartisan legislative initiatives focused on economic and national‑security resilience, including laws addressing technology supply chains and export/market controls.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
