  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Material disruptions to oil supply prompt invocation of executive emergency authorities and reallocation of decision rights to central government agencies, shifting the formal distribution of policymaking power toward the executive branch.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
