  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising shipping transit risk in Gulf chokepoints convinces policymakers that supply‑chain vulnerabilities increase strategic leverage for rivals, leading to policy moves to tighten export controls on dual‑use components and strategic technologies to limit adversaries' access.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
