  <data key="d36">Rising risk to maritime energy transit forces policymakers to weigh emergency measures (escorts, sanctions, SPR releases) and contingency plans, raising near-term unpredictability about economic and foreign-policy decisions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_flashpoint</data>
