  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising inflation expectations increase public economic anxiety and grievance narratives that hostile actors and proxy networks amplify and weaponize, producing measurable increases in volume and reach of disinformation about shortages, sanctions and government competence.</data>
