  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in major policy interest rates raise sovereign borrowing costs and tighten fiscal space for external diplomacy and foreign assistance, reducing the frequency and scale of diplomatic initiatives and mediation efforts in the Gulf over the medium term.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
