  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp net capital outflows from the affected region curtail short-term external financing and credit lines for utilities and maintenance contractors, degrading the ability to fund repairs, spare parts and emergency fixes and thus lowering infrastructure resilience.</data>
