  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in net capital flows into rival-country tech sectors (e.g., large foreign investment into Chinese AI/semiconductor firms) create political pressure in the US to tighten export controls to slow competitor capability accumulation.</data>
