  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in high‑profile legal actions and prosecutions involving tech firms or executives increases perceived litigation and regulatory risk, prompting investors and VCs to reduce or delay capital allocations to AI ventures with China‑exposure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
