  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger public alignment behind a tougher US stance on China raises audience interest and creates more newsworthy political angles, driving increased volume and persistence of media coverage on the US–China tech rivalry.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_political_shift</data>
